{"id":958,"slug":"the-killing-of-a-chinese-bookie","title":"The Killing of a Chinese Bookie","year":1976,"country":"United States","duration":135,"spine":254,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/958-the-killing-of-a-chinese-bookie","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/04d83f88552119dc45285e9671c38262/ciN1laNVIJuDLTvkmMCHSRsbrUeKwe_large.jpg","description":"John Cassavetes engages with film noir in his own inimitable style with The Killing of a Chinese Bookie. Ben Gazzara brilliantly portrays a gentleman’s club owner, Cosmo Vitelli, desperately committed to maintaining a facade of suave gentility despite the seediness of his environment and his own unhealthy appetites. When he runs afoul of loan sharks, Cosmo must carry out a terrible crime or lose his way of life. Mesmerizing and idiosyncratic, the film is a provocative examination of masculine identity. It is presented here in two versions: Cassavetes’s original 1976 edit and his 1978 one, nearly thirty minutes shorter.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"John Cassavetes","slug":"john-cassavetes"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ben Gazzara","role":"Cosmo Vitelli","slug":"ben-gazzara"},{"actor":"Timothy Agoglia Carey","role":"Flo","slug":"timothy-agoglia-carey"},{"actor":"Seymour Cassel","role":"Mort Weil","slug":"seymour-cassel"},{"actor":"Robert Phillips","role":"Phil","slug":"robert-phillips"},{"actor":"Morgan Woodward","role":"The Boss","slug":"morgan-woodward"},{"actor":"John Red Kullers","role":"The Accountant","slug":"john-red-kullers"},{"actor":"Al Ruban","role":"Marty Reitz","slug":"al-ruban"},{"actor":"Azizi Johari","role":"Rachel","slug":"azizi-johari"},{"actor":"Virginia Carrington","role":"Mama","slug":"virginia-carrington"},{"actor":"Meade Roberts","role":"Mr. Sophistication","slug":"meade-roberts"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"John Cassavetes","slug":"john-cassavetes"},{"role":"Writer","person":"John Cassavetes","slug":"john-cassavetes"},{"role":"Producer","person":